      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I am having this very same issue with the avatars SDK that was just updated today for the avatar dynamics update (VRCSDK3-AVATAR-2022.04.21.03.29_Public). This is the exact one as downloaded from the website, and reimporting does not fix the issue. The upload screen does not reflect that this is an avatar update, but instead provides a nonfunctional \"new avatar creation\" screen. Creating a new scene with a new \"Main Camera\" also does not fix the issue.",
